","st":"Andromeda","d":"Dylan descubre que el novio de Beka era Drago Musevini y usó su ADN para crear a los Nietzscheans.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/d4202587ce23a39d262a6bcc95615286/rokuFeed/assets/a87ebac3a5fa54f494236feff526628f.jpg","ep":"S05E12"},{"s":1795886566,"e":1795889537,"t":"Andromeda","st":"Andromeda","d":"Beka y Rhade encuentran una prueba que les otorgará grandes riquezas o los llevará a la locura.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/d4202587ce23a39d262a6bcc95615286/rokuFeed/assets/a87ebac3a5fa54f494236feff526628f.jpg","ep":"S05E13"},{"s":1795889537,"e":1795892508,"t":"Andromeda","st":"Andromeda","d":"Harper descubre un programa que puede destruir ocho de los planetas Seefra, matando a millones.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/d4202587ce23a39d262a6bcc95615286/rokuFeed/assets/a87ebac3a5fa54f494236feff526628f.jpg","ep":"S05E14"},{"s":1795892508,"e":1795895479,"t":"Andromeda","st":"Andromeda","d":"Mientras Harper intenta salvar Seefra, un espía ataca a Beka en la Andrómeda.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/d4202587ce23a39d262a6bcc95615286/rokuFeed/assets/a87ebac3a5fa54f494236feff526628f.jpg","ep":"S05E15"},{"s":1795895479,"e":1795898450,"t":"Andromeda","st":"Andromeda","d":"Se intenta arreglar el sol parpadeante de Seefra, pero Trance es reemplazado por un doppelganger.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/d4202587ce23a39d262a6bcc95615286/rokuFeed/assets/a87ebac3a5fa54f494236feff526628f.jpg","ep":"S05E16"},{"s":1795898450,"e":1795901421,"t":"Andromeda","st":"Andromeda","d":"Dylan sufre una grave explosión y viaja por realidades alternativas.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/d4202587ce23a39d262a6bcc95615286/rokuFeed/assets/a87ebac3a5fa54f494236feff526628f.jpg","ep":"S05E17"},{"s":1795901421,"e":1795904392,"t":"Andromeda","st":"Andromeda","d":"Rommie es reconstruido para ayudar a evacuar el sistema Seefra.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/d4202587ce23a39d262a6bcc95615286/rokuFeed/assets/a87ebac3a5fa54f494236feff526628f.jpg","ep":"S05E18"},{"s":1795904392,"e":1795907363,"t":"Andromeda","st":"Andromeda","d":"Un líder advierte que el caos en los planetas exteriores oculta un plan de saqueo.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/d4202587ce23a39d262a6bcc95615286/rokuFeed/assets/a87ebac3a5fa54f494236feff526628f.jpg","ep":"S05E19"},{"s":1795907363,"e":1795910334,"t":"Andromeda","st":"Andromeda","d":"Dylan, Rhade y Beka trabajan juntos para rescatar a Trance de Methus-2 y Harper del general Burma.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/d4202587ce23a39d262a6bcc95615286/rokuFeed/assets/a87ebac3a5fa54f494236feff526628f.jpg","ep":"S05E20"},{"s":1795910334,"e":1795913305,"t":"Andromeda","st":"Andromeda","d":"El equipo finalmente sale del sistema Seefra y descubre que Dylan es el último Paradine.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/d4202587ce23a39d262a6bcc95615286/rokuFeed/assets/a87ebac3a5fa54f494236feff526628f.jpg","ep":"S05E21"},{"s":1795913305,"e":1795916276,"t":"Andromeda","st":"Andromeda","d":"En el final de la serie, comienza la batalla final para salvar a la Mancomunidad de Nuevos Sistemas.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/d4202587ce23a39d262a6bcc95615286/rokuFeed/assets/a87ebac3a5fa54f494236feff526628f.jpg","ep":"S05E22"},{"s":1795916276,"e":1795919247,"t":"Andromeda","st":"Andromeda","d":"Beka y Tyr son atrapados en un túnel dimensional, y Dylan, Trance y Harper deben salvarlos.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/d4202587ce23a39d262a6bcc95615286/rokuFeed/assets/a87ebac3a5fa54f494236feff526628f.jpg","ep":"S03E01"},{"s":1795919247,"e":1795922218,"t":"Andromeda","st":"Andromeda","d":"Dylan es acusado de asesinato y busca un jarrón que otorga las 'bendiciones del cosmos'.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/d4202587ce23a39d262a6bcc95615286/rokuFeed/assets/a87ebac3a5fa54f494236feff526628f.jpg","ep":"S03E02"},{"s":1795922218,"e":1795925189,"t":"Andromeda","st":"Andromeda","d":"La tripulación rescata a un grupo de refugiados, sólo para descubrir que han sido objeto de experimentos gubernamentales y son extremadamente inestables.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/d4202587ce23a39d262a6bcc95615286/rokuFeed/assets/a87ebac3a5fa54f494236feff526628f.jpg","ep":"S03E03"},{"s":1795925189,"e":1795928400,"t":"Andromeda","st":"Andromeda","d":"El tío de Beka se postula para un cargo, pero un intento de asesinato obliga a la tripulación a protegerlo.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/d4202587ce23a39d262a6bcc95615286/rokuFeed/assets/a87ebac3a5fa54f494236feff526628f.jpg","ep":"S03E04"},{"s":1795928400,"e":1795931371,"t":"Andromeda","st":"Andromeda","d":"Tras un ataque pirata, la Andrómeda es rescatada por una nave perdida de la Tierra.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/d4202587ce23a39d262a6bcc95615286/rokuFeed/assets/a87ebac3a5fa54f494236feff526628f.jpg","ep":"S03E05"},{"s":1795931371,"e":1795934342,"t":"Andromeda","st":"Andromeda","d":"La tripulación descubre que un planeta pícaro, Marduk, ha estado creando armas de destrucción masiva.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/d4202587ce23a39d262a6bcc95615286/rokuFeed/assets/a87ebac3a5fa54f494236feff526628f.jpg","ep":"S03E06"},{"s":1795934342,"e":1795937313,"t":"Andromeda","st":"Andromeda","d":"Un sicario llamado el Leproso está apuntando a los líderes de la Nueva Mancomunidad.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/d4202587ce23a39d262a6bcc95615286/rokuFeed/assets/a87ebac3a5fa54f494236feff526628f.jpg","ep":"S03E07"},{"s":1795937313,"e":1795940284,"t":"Andromeda","st":"Andromeda","d":"La Andrómeda está atormentada por una misteriosa criatura qu