pe/roku-trc/context/trc/id/d4202587ce23a39d262a6bcc95615286/rokuFeed/assets/a87ebac3a5fa54f494236feff526628f.jpg","ep":"S03E13"},{"s":1795955139,"e":1795958110,"t":"Andromeda","st":"Andromeda","d":"Beka pone en peligro tanto a su tripulación como a todo un planeta cuando aparece un antiguo amor.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/d4202587ce23a39d262a6bcc95615286/rokuFeed/assets/a87ebac3a5fa54f494236feff526628f.jpg","ep":"S03E14"},{"s":1795958110,"e":1795961081,"t":"Andromeda","st":"Andromeda","d":"La Andrómeda recibe un grito de ayuda del Rev Bam.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/d4202587ce23a39d262a6bcc95615286/rokuFeed/assets/a87ebac3a5fa54f494236feff526628f.jpg","ep":"S03E15"},{"s":1795961081,"e":1795964052,"t":"Andromeda","st":"Andromeda","d":"Tras un ataque Pyrian, Dylan debe defender un planeta de la Mancomunidad.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/d4202587ce23a39d262a6bcc95615286/rokuFeed/assets/a87ebac3a5fa54f494236feff526628f.jpg","ep":"S03E16"},{"s":1795964052,"e":1795967023,"t":"Andromeda","st":"Andromeda","d":"Dylan oye voces que le llaman a un planeta de \"fuego y hielo\".","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/d4202587ce23a39d262a6bcc95615286/rokuFeed/assets/a87ebac3a5fa54f494236feff526628f.jpg","ep":"S03E17"},{"s":1795967023,"e":1795969994,"t":"Andromeda","st":"Andromeda","d":"En medio de una disputa Nietzschean, un prisionero revela la existencia de un mapa secreto.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/d4202587ce23a39d262a6bcc95615286/rokuFeed/assets/a87ebac3a5fa54f494236feff526628f.jpg","ep":"S03E18"},{"s":1795969994,"e":1795972965,"t":"Andromeda","st":"Andromeda","d":"Un giro equivocado después de salir de una corriente de deslizamiento envía la Andrómeda al sistema Prolon. Rescatan una cápsula de escape de un desastre seguro, pero el orgullo la quiere de vuelta.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/d4202587ce23a39d262a6bcc95615286/rokuFeed/assets/a87ebac3a5fa54f494236feff526628f.jpg","ep":"S03E19"},{"s":1795972965,"e":1795975936,"t":"Andromeda","st":"Andromeda","d":"La tripulación busca una colonia perdida y halla aliados secretos.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/d4202587ce23a39d262a6bcc95615286/rokuFeed/assets/a87ebac3a5fa54f494236feff526628f.jpg","ep":"S03E20"},{"s":1795975936,"e":1795978907,"t":"Andromeda","st":"Andromeda","d":"La tripulación instala una nueva IA en un acorazado, pero todo sale mal.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/d4202587ce23a39d262a6bcc95615286/rokuFeed/assets/a87ebac3a5fa54f494236feff526628f.jpg","ep":"S03E21"},{"s":1795978907,"e":1795981878,"t":"Andromeda","st":"Andromeda","d":"Tyr convence a los Nietzscheans de que él es la reencarnación de Drago Museveni.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/d4202587ce23a39d262a6bcc95615286/rokuFeed/assets/a87ebac3a5fa54f494236feff526628f.jpg","ep":"S03E22"},{"s":1795981878,"e":1795984849,"t":"Andromeda","st":"Andromeda","d":"Un mensaje lleva a Dylan a rescatar a un rehén y buscar la flota de la Mancomunidad.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/d4202587ce23a39d262a6bcc95615286/rokuFeed/assets/a87ebac3a5fa54f494236feff526628f.jpg","ep":"S04E01"},{"s":1795984849,"e":1795987820,"t":"Andromeda","st":"Andromeda","d":"El Ciudadano Ocho intenta remover a Dylan del mando de la Andrómeda.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/d4202587ce23a39d262a6bcc95615286/rokuFeed/assets/a87ebac3a5fa54f494236feff526628f.jpg","ep":"S04E02"},{"s":1795987820,"e":1795990791,"t":"Andromeda","st":"Andromeda","d":"La tripulación debe detener a un constructor naval mundial antes de lanzar otra invasión.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/d4202587ce23a39d262a6bcc95615286/rokuFeed/assets/a87ebac3a5fa54f494236feff526628f.jpg","ep":"S04E03"},{"s":1795990791,"e":1795993762,"t":"Andromeda","st":"Andromeda","d":"Dylan es secuestrado por Nietscheans y obligado a jugar juegos mentales para la diversión de sus captores.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/d4202587ce23a39d262a6bcc95615286/rokuFeed/assets/a87ebac3a5fa54f494236feff526628f.jpg","ep":"S04E04"},{"s":1795993762,"e":1795996733,"t":"Andromeda","st":"Andromeda","d":"Dos hermanos Nietzschean disputan un arma que anula funciones cerebrales.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/d4202587ce23a39d262a6bcc95615286/rokuFeed/assets/a87ebac3a5fa54f494236feff526628f.jpg","ep":"S04E05"},{"s":1795996733,"e":1795999704,"t":"Andromeda","st":"Andromeda","d":"Aliado con los Coleccionistas, Tyr vuelve para reclamar la Ruta de las Edades.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/d4202587ce23a39d262a6bcc95615286/rokuFeed/assets/a87ebac3a5fa54f494236feff526628f.jpg","ep":"S04E06"},{"s":1795999704,"e":1796002675,"t":"Andromeda","st":"Andromeda","d":"Una situación de rehenes se produce cuando la tripulación se enfrenta a Tyr.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/d4202587ce23a39d262a6bcc95615286/rokuFeed/assets/a87ebac3a5fa54f494236feff526628f.jpg","ep":"S04E07"},{"s":1796002675,"e":1796005646,"t":"Andromeda","st":"Andromeda","d":"Un giro equivocado en la corriente de deslizamiento lleva a Andrómeda a un motín en la prisión.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/d4202587ce23a39d262a6bcc95615286/rokuFeed/assets/a87ebac3a5fa54f494236feff526628f.jpg","ep":"S04E08"},{"s":1796005646,"e":1796008617,"t":"Andromeda","st":"Andromeda","d":"La tripulación de Andrómeda se levanta para averiguar quién mató a un grupo de científicos.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/d4202587ce23a39d262a6bcc95615286/rokuFeed/assets/a87ebac3a5fa54f494236feff526628f.jpg","ep":"S04E09"},{"s":1796008617,"e":1796011588,"t":"Andromeda","st":"Andromeda","d":"La tripulación debe rescatar a una princesa, pero ella en realidad huye de su padre asesino.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/d4202587ce23a39d262a6bcc95615286/rokuFeed/assets/a87ebac3a5fa54f494236feff526628f.jpg","ep":"S04E10"},{"s":1796011588,"e":1796014800,"t":"Andromeda","st":"Andromeda","d":"Los Coleccionistas ahora controlan la Mancomunidad y someten a juicio a la tripulación de Andrómeda.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/d4202587ce23a39d262a6bcc95615286/rokuFeed/assets/a87ebac3a5fa54f494236feff526628f.jpg","ep":"S04E11"},{"s":1796014800,"e":1796017771,"t":"Andromeda","st":"Andromeda","d":"La Andrómeda descubre un cargamento de bio-armadura.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/d4202587ce23a39d262a6bcc95615286/rokuFeed/assets/a87ebac3a5fa54f494236feff526628f.jpg","ep":"S04E12"},{"s":1796017771,"e":1796020742,"t":"Andromeda","st":"Andromeda","d":"Un dispositivo de ocultación experimental deja caer a Dylan en un universo alternativo.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/d4202587ce23a39d262a6bcc95615286/rokuFeed/assets/a87ebac3a5fa54f494236feff526628f.jpg","ep":"S04E13"},{"s":1796020742,"e":1796023713,"t":"Andromeda","st":"Andromeda","d":"La Andrómeda queda atrapada en una guerra entre dos naves e incluye una enfermedad fatal.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/d4202587ce23a39d262a6bcc95615286/rokuFeed/assets/a87ebac3a5fa54f494236feff526628f.jpg","ep":"S04E14"},{"s":1796023713,"e":1796026684,"t":"Andromeda","st":"Andromeda","d":"Dylan es engañado por Rev y secuestrado. La tripulación encuentra un aliado inesperado en un coleccionista.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/d4202587ce23a39d262a6bcc95615286/rokuFeed/assets/a87ebac3a5fa54f494236feff526628f.jpg","ep":"S04E15"},{"s":1796026684,"e":1796029655,"t":"Andromeda","st":"Andromeda","d":"El Abismo ha infectado a Beka. La tripulación debe encontrar la manera de salvarla.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/d4202587ce23a39d262a6bcc95615286/rokuFeed/assets/a87ebac3a5fa54f494236feff526628f.jpg","ep":"S04E16"},{"s":1796029655,"e":1796032626,"t":"Andromeda","st":"Andromeda","d":"Con su equipo prisionero, Harper es forzado a crear un puente de tiempo para el Patriarca.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/d4202587ce23a39d262a6bcc95615286/rokuFeed/assets/a87ebac3a5fa54f494236feff526628f.jpg","ep":"S04E17"},{"s":1796032626,"e":1796035597,"t":"Andromeda","st":"Andromeda","d":"Un espía de Tri Gemma aparece en la Andrómeda en un intento de robar el mapa estelar.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/d4202587ce23a39d262a6bcc95615286/rokuFeed/assets/a87ebac3a5fa54f494236feff526628f.jpg","ep":"S04E18"},{"s":1796035597,"e":1796038568,"t":"Andromeda","st":"Andromeda","d":"Cuando Rommie se vuelve demasiado emocional, la nave le corta el acceso para hacer diagnósticos.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/d4202587ce23a39d262a6bcc95615286/rokuFeed/assets/a87ebac3a5fa54f494236feff526628f.jpg","ep":"S04E19"},{"s":1796038568,"e":1796041539,"t":"Andromeda","st":"Andromeda","d":"El Abismo mata al amigo de Beka, y la tripulación debe averiguar por qué información mataron.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/d4202587ce23a39d262a6bcc95615286/rokuFeed/assets/a87ebac3a5fa54f494236feff526628f.jpg","ep":"S04E20"},{"s":1796038568,"e":1796041539,"t":"Andromeda","st":"Andromeda","d":"El Abismo mata al amigo de Beka, y la tripulación debe averiguar por qué información mataron.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/d4202587ce23a39d262a6bcc95615286/rokuFeed/assets/a87ebac3a5fa54f494236feff526628f.jpg","ep":"S04E20"},{"s":1796041539,"e":1796044510,"t":"Andromeda","st":"Andromeda","d":"Andrómeda rescata a un barco que regresa de las conversaciones de paz con los Magog.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/d4202587ce23a39d262a6bcc95615286/rokuFeed/assets/a87ebac3a5fa54f494236feff526628f.jpg","ep":"S04E21"},{"s":1796044510,"e":1796047481,"t":"Andromeda","st":"Andromeda","d":"El ataque Magog tiene consecuencias nefastas.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/d4202587ce23a39d262a6bcc95615286/rokuFeed/assets/a87ebac3a5fa54f494236feff526628f.jpg","ep":"S04E22"},{"s":1796047481,"e":1796050452,"t":"Andromeda","st":"Andromeda","d":"Dylan termina en Seefra, donde la población supersticiosa no tiene tecnología.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/d4202587ce23a39d262a6bcc95615286/rokuFeed/assets/a87ebac3a5fa54f494236feff526628f.jpg","ep":"S05E01"},{"s":1796050452,"e":1796053423,"t":"Andromeda","st":"Andromeda","d":"Beka es arrojado en Seefra después de que la Andrómeda es robada, y Dylan debe probar que la nave es suya.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/d4202587ce23a39d262a6bcc95615286/rokuFeed/assets/a87ebac3a5fa54f494236feff526628f.jpg","ep":"S05E02"},{"s":1796053423,"e":1796056395,"t":"Andromeda","st":"Andromeda","d":"Todavía en Seefra, Dylan encuentra a Harper, que se ha adaptado a la vida allí.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/d4202587ce23a39d262a6bcc95615286/rokuFeed/assets/a87ebac3a5fa54f494236feff526628f.jpg","ep":"S05E03"},{"s":1796056395,"e":1796059366,"t":"Andromeda","st":"Andromeda","d":"Resulta que Doyle es un androide, construido por Harper para contener la programación central de Rommie.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/d4202587ce23a39d262a6bcc95615286/rokuFeed/assets/a87ebac3a5fa54f494236feff526628f.jpg","ep":"S05E04"},{"s":1796059366,"e":1796062337,"t":"Andromeda","st":"Andromeda","d":"Beka gana un premio de un DJ de radio, aprende la verdad sobre Seefra y localiza el diagrama de Meethus.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/d4202587ce23a39d262a6bcc95615286/rokuFeed/assets/a87ebac3a5fa54f494236feff526628f.jpg","ep":"S05E05"},{"s":1796062337,"e":1796065308,"t":"Andromeda","st":"Andromeda","d":"Un científico de la Mancomunidad original aparece, atrapado en un bucle de tiempo.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/d4202587ce23a39d262a6bcc95615286/rokuFeed/assets/a87ebac3a5fa54f494236feff526628f.jpg","ep":"S05E06"},{"s":1796065308,"e":1796068279,"t":"Andromeda","st":"Andromeda","d":"Flavin regresa, provocando una guerra de pandillas, y ayuda a Dylan a desarrollarse como Paradine.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/d4202587ce23a39d262a6bcc95615286/rokuFeed/assets/a87ebac3a5fa54f494236feff526628f.jpg","ep":"S05E07"},{"s":1796068279,"e":1796071250,"t":"Andromeda","st":"Andromeda","d":"Dylan trabaja en una mina para obtener un cristal que restaure la Andrómeda.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/d4202587ce23a39d262a6bcc95615286/rokuFeed/assets/a87ebac3a5fa54f494236feff526628f.jpg","ep":"S05E08"},{"s":1796071250,"e":1796074221,"t":"Andromeda","st":"Andromeda","d":"Los túneles se descubren en Seefra que se pueden utilizar para llegar a otros ocho planetas Seefra.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/d4202587ce23a39d262a6bcc95615286/rokuFeed/assets/a87ebac3a5fa54f494236feff526628f.jpg","ep":"S05E09"},{"s":1796074221,"e":1796077192,"t":"Andromeda","st":"Andromeda","d":"Cuando un anciano es asesinado, Beka, Rhade y Harper son los principales sospechosos y son juzgados.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/d4202587ce23a39d262a6bcc95615286/rokuFeed/assets/a87ebac3a5fa54f494236feff526628f.jpg","ep":"S05E10"},{"s":1796077192,"e":1796080163,"t":"Andromeda","st":"Andromeda","d":"Rhade lidera a los rebeldes en la batalla contra un señor de la guerra en Seefra-5.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/d4202587ce23a39d262a6bcc95615286/rokuFeed/assets/a87ebac3a5fa54f494236feff526628f.jpg","ep":"S05E11"},{"s":1796080163,"e":1796083134,"t":"Andromeda","st":"Andromeda","d":"Dylan descubre que el novio de Beka era Drago Musevini y usó su ADN para crear a los Nietzscheans.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/d4202587ce23a39d262a6bcc95615286/rokuFeed/assets/a87ebac3a5fa54f494236feff526628f.jpg","ep":"S05E12"},{"s":1796083134,"e":1796086105,"t":"Andromeda","st":"Andromeda","d":"Beka y Rhade encuentran una prueba que les otorgará grandes riquezas o los llevará a la locura.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/d4202587ce23a39d262a6bcc95615286/rokuFeed/assets/a87ebac3a5fa54f494236feff526628f.jpg","ep":"S05E13"},{"s":1796086105,"e":1796089076,"t":"Andromeda","st":"Andromeda","d":"Harper descubre un programa que puede destruir ocho de los planetas Seefra, matando a millones.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/d4202587ce23a39d262a6bcc95615286/rokuFeed/assets/a87ebac3a5fa54f494236feff526628f.jpg","ep":"S05E14"},{"s":1796089076,"e":1796092047,"t":"Andromeda","st":"Andromeda","d":"Mientras Harper intenta salvar Seefra, un espía ataca a Beka en la Andrómeda.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/d4202587ce23a39d262a6bcc95615286/rokuFeed/assets/a87ebac3a5fa54f494236feff526628f.jpg","ep":"S05E15"},{"s":1796092047,"e":1796095018,"t":"Andromeda","st":"Andromeda","d":"Se intenta arreglar el sol parpadeante de Seefra, pero Trance es reemplazado por un doppelganger.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/d4202587ce23a39d262a6bcc95615286/rokuFeed/assets/a87ebac3a5fa54f494236feff526628f.jpg","ep":"S05E16"},{"s":1796095018,"e":1796097989,"t":"Andromeda","st":"Andromeda","d":"Dylan sufre una grave explosión y viaja por realidades alternativas.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/d4202587ce23a39d262a6bcc95615286/rokuFeed/assets/a87ebac3a5fa54f494236feff526628f.jpg","ep":"S05E17"},{"s":1796097989,"e":1796101200,"t":"Andromeda","st":"Andromeda","d":"Rommie es reconstruido para ayudar a evacuar el sistema Seefra.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/d4202587ce23a39d262a6bcc95615286/rokuFeed/assets/a87ebac3a5fa54f494236feff526628f.jpg","ep":"S05E18"},{"s":1796101200,"e":1796104171,"t":"Andromeda","st":"Andromeda","d":"Un líder advierte que el caos en los planetas exteriores oculta un plan de saqueo.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/d4202587ce23a39d262a6bcc95615286/rokuFeed/assets/a87ebac3a5fa54f494236feff526628f.jpg","ep":"S05E19"},{"s":1796104171,"e":1796107142,"t":"Andromeda","st":"Andromeda","d":"Dylan, Rhade y Beka trabajan juntos para rescatar a Trance de Methus-2 y Harper del general Burma.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/d4202587ce23a39d262a6bcc95615286/rokuFeed/assets/a87ebac3a5fa54f494236feff526628f.jpg","ep":"S05E20"},{"s":1796107142,"e":1796110113,"t":"Andromeda","st":"Andromeda","d":"El equipo finalmente sale del sistema Seefra y descubre que Dylan es el último Paradine.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/d4202587ce23a39d262a6bcc95615286/rokuFeed/assets/a87ebac3a5fa54f494236feff526628f.jpg","ep":"S05E21"},{"s":1796110113,"e":1796113084,"t":"Andromeda","st":"Andromeda","d":"En el final de la serie, comienza la batalla final para salvar a la Mancomunidad de Nuevos Sistemas.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/d4202587ce23a39d262a6bcc95615286/rokuFeed/assets/a87ebac3a5fa54f494236feff526628f.jpg","ep":"S05E22"},{"s":1796113084,"e":1796116055,"t":"Andromeda","st":"Andromeda","d":"Beka y Tyr son atrapados en un túnel dimensional, y Dylan, Trance y Harper deben salvarlos.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/d4202587ce23a39d262a6bcc95615286/rokuFeed/assets/a87ebac3a5fa54f494236feff526628f.jpg","ep":"S03E01"},{"s":1796116055,"e":1796119026,"t":"Andromeda","st":"Andromeda","d":"Dylan es acusado de asesinato y busca un jarrón que otorga las 'bendiciones del cosmos'.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/d4202587ce23a39d262a6bcc95615286/rokuFeed/assets/a87ebac3a5fa54f494236feff526628f.jpg","ep":"S03E02"},{"s":1796119026,"e":1796121997,"t":"Andromeda","st":"Andromeda","d":"La tripulación rescata a un grupo de refugiados, sólo para descubrir que han sido objeto de experimentos gubernamentales y son extremadamente inestables.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/d4202587ce23a39d262a6bcc95615286/rokuFeed/assets/a87ebac3a5fa54f494236feff526628f.jpg","ep":"S03E03"},{"s":1796121997,"e":1796124968,"t":"Andromeda","st":"Andromeda","d":"El tío de Beka se postula para un cargo, pero un intento de asesinato obliga a la tripulación a protegerlo.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/d4202587ce23a39d262a6bcc95615286/rokuFeed/assets/a87ebac3a5fa54f494236feff526628f.jpg","ep":"S03E04"},{"s":1796124968,"e":1796127939,"t":"Andromeda","st":"Andromeda","d":"Tras un ataque pirata, la Andrómeda es rescatada por una nave perdida de la Tierra.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/d4202587ce23a39d262a6bcc95615286/rokuFeed/assets/a87ebac3a5fa54f494236feff526628f.jpg","ep":"S03E05"}]